<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Instagram Account Recovery Help</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 430px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 30px 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #d62976;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #222;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .steps {
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .step {
      background: #f7f7f7;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .step b {
      color: #d62976;
    }

    .recover-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #d62976;
      color: white;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .recover-btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .warning {
      background: #fff4e5;
      color: #7a4b00;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .footer {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="logo">Instagram Help</div>

    <h1>Recover Your Instagram Account</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
      Having trouble accessing your Instagram account?
      Follow the official recovery process below.
    </p>

    <div class="steps">

      <div class="step">
        <b>1.</b> Click the recovery button below.
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <b>2.</b> Enter the information requested by Instagram.
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <b>3.</b> Follow Instagram's instructions to recover your account.
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="warning">
      <b>Security Notice:</b><br>
      Never share your Instagram password, OTP, recovery code,
      or login information with this website or anyone else.
    </div>

    <a
      class="recover-btn"
      href="https://www.instagram.com/accounts/password/reset/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Recover Instagram Account
    </a>

    <div class="footer">
      This is an independent help website and is not affiliated
      with or operated by Instagram.
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
